' Run test: tfdesign on designer_frm.files/panel.bas, whose form block is
' in the .bas: File > Move form to .frm (answering Yes) takes it out into
' panel.frm, then the Add menu adds a Timer and a ComboBox, and Ctrl+S
' saves them to the .frm.
Name=tfdesign
Startup=Sub Main
Form=../../designer/window.bas
Module=../../designer/designer.bas
Module=../../designer/model.bas
Module=../../designer/catalog.bas
Module=../../designer/files.bas
